---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice" description="Privacy notice for Talkintree.com.">
  <section class="privacy-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Talkintree</p><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p>How Talkintree handles the information you choose to share.</p></div></section>
  <section class="paper section privacy-content"><div class="container"><p class="updated">Last updated: August 17, 2026</p><div class="privacy-grid"><aside><p class="eyebrow">At a glance</p><p>Talkintree collects only the information you submit through the contact form or by email, and uses it to respond to your inquiry.</p></aside><div><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you use the Talkintree contact form, you may provide your name, email address, organization or website, inquiry type, and message. If you email us directly, we receive the information included in that email.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use this information only to respond to your inquiry, discuss a possible engagement or collaboration, and maintain reasonable records of communications. We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p><h2>How form submissions are handled</h2><p>The contact form is managed through Netlify Forms. Form submissions are stored in the Talkintree Netlify account so they can be reviewed and responded to. We do not ask visitors to include sensitive personal, financial, health, or confidential information in the contact form.</p><h2>Sharing and external links</h2><p>Talkintree links to external services such as Amazon, LinkedIn, and YouTube. Those sites have their own privacy practices. Please review their policies before sharing information or making a purchase on those services.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask us to correct or delete a message you have sent, subject to any information we need to retain for legitimate administrative purposes. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:talkintree85@gmail.com">talkintree85@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>Updates to this notice</h2><p>We may update this notice as Talkintree grows or its services change. The current version will always be available on this page.</p><p class="notice">This notice is intended to explain Talkintree’s current practices and is not a substitute for legal advice tailored to a specific jurisdiction.</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .privacy-hero{padding:11rem 0 5rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 72% 18%,#334839,#131a14 47%,#0d0d0d 77%)}.privacy-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.6rem,7vw,6.4rem);letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:.75rem 0 1rem}.privacy-hero p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d3ccc0;font-size:1.08rem}.updated{color:#716a5e;font-size:.78rem;margin:0 0 3rem}.privacy-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:7rem}.privacy-grid aside{border-top:1px solid #d8cdb9;padding-top:1rem}.privacy-grid aside p:not(.eyebrow){color:#5d574d}.privacy-grid h2{font-size:1.65rem;margin:2.2rem 0 .65rem}.privacy-grid h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.privacy-grid div>p{color:#585249;font-size:1rem}.privacy-grid a{color:#674e1a;text-decoration:underline}.notice{font-size:.82rem!important;border-top:1px solid #d8cdb9;padding-top:1.25rem;margin-top:2rem}@media(max-width:720px){.privacy-hero{padding-top:9rem}.privacy-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.5rem}}
</style>
